---
---
<section class="bg-[#111111] py-28 px-6">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
    <span class="block text-[10px] font-bold tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-[#FFD100] mb-5">From Our Community</span>
    <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-14">What people are saying</h2>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-px bg-[#FFD100]/10">
      {[
        { quote: '[You speak intelligently and break it down simply, those of us who are not finance professionals can understand the concept. Thanks especially for the explanation on NGX, you are doing an excellent work', name: '[Seun, O.]'},
        { quote: '[My background and experience had taught me to always play it safe to an extreme that I had only focused on savings which loses value to inflation. So diversification and compounding are the two main areas of growth for me]', name: '[Iyiola, O.]'},
        { quote: '[The syndicate deals are well-vetted and accessible, providing a great way to build a diversified portfolio.Highly recommended for any aspiring investor.]', name: '[Olayemi, O.]' },
      ].map((t) => (
        <div class="bg-black p-10">
          <p class="italic text-white text-base leading-relaxed mb-8">"{t.quote}"</p>
          <div class="text-xs font-bold tracking-wider text-[#FFD100]">{t.name}</div>
          <div class="text-xs text-white/40 mt-1">{t.role}</div>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<hr class="border-none h-px bg-[#FFD100]/15" />
